{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年30歲的「馬來西亞女神」林宣妤（Serene），早於在2017年參選《國際中華小姐》奪得亞軍後簽約TVB，備受力捧，曾參與劇集《她她她的少女時代》、《反黑路人甲》、《使徒行者3》，但其後她未能適應香港的生活節奏，而離巢回流馬來西亞發展。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.478878+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:23.210804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:23.210804+00:00","content_hash":"1947eb1d0674640a1f9101190c0a9c890df81b424d10758a86e56cecd3b036a9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}